---
const learningStudioUrl = 'https://learning-studio.netlify.app/';
const studioHighlights = [
	'Reusable course layouts',
	'Knowledge checks',
	'Branching scenarios',
	'Reusable content blocks',
	'Multimedia learning components'
];
const studioSignals = ['Astro prototype', 'UX-led learning design', 'Portfolio centerpiece'];
---

<section
	id="learning-studio"
	class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-white/10 bg-slate-950 px-6 py-20 sm:px-8 lg:px-12"
>
	<div class="absolute inset-0 -z-20 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top_left,_rgba(34,211,238,0.16),_transparent_24%),radial-gradient(circle_at_82%_18%,_rgba(244,114,182,0.14),_transparent_24%),radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_100%,_rgba(250,204,21,0.12),_transparent_26%),linear-gradient(180deg,_rgba(2,6,23,0.98),_rgba(15,23,42,1))]"></div>
	<div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 -z-10 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-cyan-200/40 to-transparent"></div>
	<div class="absolute left-12 top-20 -z-10 h-48 w-48 rounded-full bg-cyan-300/10 blur-3xl"></div>
	<div class="absolute right-0 top-28 -z-10 h-56 w-56 rounded-full bg-fuchsia-300/10 blur-3xl"></div>

	<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
		<div class="max-w-5xl">
			<p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-cyan-200/72">
				Featured Learning Experience
			</p>
			<h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">
				Learning Studio
			</h2>
			<p class="mt-5 max-w-4xl text-base leading-7 text-slate-200/84 sm:text-lg">
				Learning Studio is a modern digital learning showcase I built to demonstrate
				how interactive course experiences can be designed, structured, and presented
				for instructional designers, learning teams, and digital learning portfolios.
				It brings together reusable layouts, interaction patterns, knowledge checks,
				branching scenarios, and multimedia learning components in one polished
				studio-style environment.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-base leading-7 text-slate-300 sm:text-lg">
				This project was created to show my ability to move beyond static e-learning
				and build lightweight, engaging, web-based learning experiences using modern
				front-end tools, thoughtful UX, and learner-focused design.
			</p>
		</div>

		<article
			class="group relative isolate mt-12 overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] shadow-[0_28px_80px_rgba(2,8,23,0.55)] backdrop-blur-sm transition duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-cyan-200/30"
		>
			<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(120deg,rgba(8,47,73,0.78)_0%,rgba(17,24,39,0.78)_42%,rgba(82,24,77,0.62)_100%)]"></div>
			<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.06)_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.06)_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:34px_34px] opacity-[0.16]"></div>
			<div class="absolute inset-y-0 right-0 w-[44%] bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,_rgba(103,232,249,0.22),_transparent_68%)] opacity-80"></div>

			<div class="relative grid gap-8 px-6 py-7 sm:px-8 sm:py-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.1fr)_minmax(320px,0.95fr)] lg:items-center lg:gap-10 lg:px-10 lg:py-10">
				<div class="max-w-2xl">
					<p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-cyan-100/78 sm:text-sm">
						Modern digital learning showcase
					</p>
					<h3 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[0.01em] text-white sm:text-5xl">
						A studio-style portfolio piece for interactive learning design.
					</h3>
					<p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-sm leading-7 text-slate-100/84 sm:text-base">
						Designed to feel product-level rather than slide-based, Learning Studio
						showcases how modern learning experiences can be modular, elegant, and
						built for the web.
					</p>

					<div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap sm:items-center">
						<a
							href={learningStudioUrl}
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
							class="inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-cyan-100/92 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 shadow-[0_18px_36px_rgba(8,47,73,0.32)] transition duration-300 hover:bg-white focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-cyan-100 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-slate-950 sm:w-auto"
						>
							View Learning Studio
						</a>
						<span class="inline-flex w-fit items-center rounded-full border border-white/12 bg-slate-950/35 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-cyan-100/82 backdrop-blur-sm">
							Senior-level showcase
						</span>
					</div>

					<div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2.5">
						{studioSignals.map((signal) => (
							<span class="rounded-full border border-cyan-200/18 bg-cyan-300/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-[0.68rem] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-cyan-50/82">
								{signal}
							</span>
						))}
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="relative">
					<div class="absolute inset-x-8 top-6 h-24 rounded-full bg-cyan-300/12 blur-3xl"></div>
					<div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/45 p-4 shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(2,8,23,0.3)] backdrop-blur-md sm:p-5">
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-3">
							<div class="flex items-center gap-2" aria-hidden="true">
								<span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-rose-300/85"></span>
								<span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-300/85"></span>
								<span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-300/85"></span>
							</div>
							<p class="text-[0.68rem] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-slate-300/80">
								Studio Modules
							</p>
						</div>

						<div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
							{studioHighlights.map((highlight) => (
								<div class="rounded-[1.2rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.05] p-4">
									<p class="text-[0.68rem] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-cyan-100/66">
										Module
									</p>
									<p class="mt-3 text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-white">
										{highlight}
									</p>
									<div class="mt-4 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/8">
										<div class="h-full w-[72%] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-300 via-sky-200 to-fuchsia-300"></div>
									</div>
								</div>
							))}
						</div>

						<div class="mt-4 rounded-[1.2rem] border border-white/10 bg-[linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(34,211,238,0.12),rgba(244,114,182,0.12))] p-4">
							<p class="text-[0.68rem] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-slate-200/70">
								Experience goal
							</p>
							<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-100/84">
								Show how polished web-based learning can feel dynamic, modular, and
								portfolio-ready without losing clarity or learner focus.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</article>
	</div>
</section>
